Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a new comic for sale!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.98,0:00:10.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like one copy, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.98,0:00:13.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course. Here you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.09,0:00:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your support!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.79,0:01:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look quite right...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.63,0:01:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura? The bathroom's free.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give me a minute. I need to—
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.59,0:01:31.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, now. Hurry up and take a bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.08,0:01:37.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A swordswoman...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.42,0:01:42.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's hard to picture in my mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm bad at drawing strong women...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.49,0:01:48.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.07,0:01:50.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's got a nice figure...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.09,0:01:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she's driven, and she follows her heart...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.95,0:01:57.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That might work!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.27,0:02:06.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.47,0:02:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cosplay...?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Vendors...?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.11,0:02:13.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be attending an event soon,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.97,0:02:18.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I was hoping you two could\Nhelp me out with it...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.39,0:02:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of event?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.79,0:02:23.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manga?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.39,0:02:30.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's called "doujinshi."
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.20,0:02:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I drew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, no way! It's so good!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.91,0:02:35.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This art is fantastic!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.24,0:02:37.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida, I had no idea you were so talented!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.62,0:02:38.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.78,0:02:41.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, um... maybe don't look at it so closely.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.79,0:02:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've loved anime and manga since I was little,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.58,0:02:50.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I've been selling comics at these\Ntypes of events for quite some time now.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.34,0:02:52.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh, I didn't know that was a thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.09,0:02:55.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.07,0:02:58.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love walking into the venue and\Nfeeling the enthusiasm in the air!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.34,0:03:01.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted my latest comic to be\Na classic fantasy story,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.64,0:03:05.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I based the daring swordswoman on you,\NBell, so if you work the booth—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.99,0:03:05.24,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,M-Mochida...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.81,0:03:09.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.24,0:03:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about this stuff...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.63,0:03:13.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but since you asked, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.76,0:03:15.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'mean it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.74,0:03:17.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.07,0:03:19.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're in, right, Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.26,0:03:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure am. We'd be happy to help you out.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.46,0:03:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, in that case...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.38,0:03:28.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are you free after school today?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.96,0:03:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.29,0:03:35.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this is what your room looks like.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.43,0:03:36.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.30,0:03:40.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara's in my room...!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming we can't buy the costumes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.40,0:03:45.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's an original design.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.76,0:03:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After I take your measurements,\NI can ask a friend of mine to make it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.54,0:03:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll probably make the accessories myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still not done with my manuscript, though...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then don't stress yourself out.\NWe can wear normal—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.55,0:03:57.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.32,0:04:00.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since you two are helping me,\Nthe costumes are non-negotiable!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.84,0:04:03.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's start with your measurements, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.34,0:04:04.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.25,0:04:10.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha—? Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.46,0:04:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to take off your underwear...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.58,0:04:16.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to get\Nyour measurements now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.30,0:04:21.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry. On to the next one.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, you really do have a great figure.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.49,0:04:32.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.19,0:04:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bet Sunohara prefers her body type over mine...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.37,0:04:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't give me that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.87,0:04:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to cosplay with us, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.41,0:04:44.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm good!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.37,0:04:47.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just wanted the two of you to do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.58,0:04:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the star of the event,\Nso you have to dress up, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.47,0:04:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see what's happening.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.08,0:05:01.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forcing me and Hinata to do all the work\Nwhile you sit back and enjoy yourself...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.30,0:05:04.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How cruel! It's totally unfair!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.26,0:05:07.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.02,0:05:08.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.49,0:05:10.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and take your clothes off.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.69,0:05:12.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha—? Bell...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't put up a fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.73,0:05:15.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, Bell! Hold on!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.82,0:05:25.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, I think it's time we measure\Nevery square inch of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.21,0:05:27.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.71,0:05:30.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they okay in there...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.10,0:05:31.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.88,0:05:36.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess it's Hinata's turn next.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.35,0:05:38.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.05,0:05:40.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.15,0:05:44.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're done with our measurements.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.22,0:05:46.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and take yours now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.65,0:05:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least put on some clothes first!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.67,0:06:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.79,0:06:11.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow! I didn't realize the event venue\Nwould be so big!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Check-in's over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There'll be a dressing room once we're inside,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.77,0:06:17.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we can get changed in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well? What do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.65,0:06:25.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look adorable!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.39,0:06:27.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect reproduction!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.32,0:06:30.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I asked my friend to make\Nthe bust portion pretty big,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.15,0:06:32.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it still accentuates all the right places!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.94,0:06:36.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I think I might be falling in love\Nwith my own character!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.70,0:06:39.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks. You look cute, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.43,0:06:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way! You look way cuter than I do, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mochida?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.82,0:06:50.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Doesn't my costume seem a little... feminine?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.84,0:06:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's okay!\NThere's plenty of demand for that!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.67,0:06:55.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Demand for what?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.29,0:06:58.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is something wrong, Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HINATA!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.97,0:07:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata— no... Hinata-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.23,0:07:10.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your big sister's about to take you\Nsomeplace lots of fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.34,0:07:13.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I promise I'll be gentle!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.02,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing, Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.02,0:07:14.77,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Mochida, make her stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.77,0:07:16.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm on Bell's side.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.44,0:07:18.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's have a photoshoot later, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.65,0:07:19.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.01,0:07:29.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As of now, the 22nd SunComi Expo\Nhas officially begun.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.59,0:07:32.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You guys, the event's starting!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.37,0:07:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, clap!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.13,0:07:42.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I made too many...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.18,0:07:44.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.34,0:07:47.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing! We've got this!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One comic, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.84,0:07:54.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much! Here you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I take a look?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.55,0:08:09.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks for your support!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.37,0:08:13.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sold one... Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'mind if I flip through it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, go ahead!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.77,0:08:22.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The end of the line is here!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.51,0:08:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The vendors at this booth\Nare on a whole other level.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.47,0:08:37.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm beat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like the rush is finally dying down.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.35,0:08:43.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never had this many people\Nvisit my booth before.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.40,0:08:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's the truth!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.09,0:08:52.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, they hardly ever have\Ncosplayers of this caliber!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.82,0:08:55.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara looks downright adorable, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.41,0:08:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a popular genre for sure, but getting\Nthis much business with an original comic?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.63,0:09:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear, it's practically a miracle—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.54,0:09:04.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry! I got excited again...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.56,0:09:07.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.01,0:09:09.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're having fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've thought this ever since we first met,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.93,0:09:15.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you're passionate about\Nthe things you love.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You pour your heart into them.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.31,0:09:22.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what I like the most about you, Sakura.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.55,0:09:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until now, I never had any friends who\NI could talk to about these types of hobbies...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.04,0:09:35.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm having a blast today!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.99,0:09:37.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're Miss Sakura, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.21,0:09:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.63,0:09:45.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, could I get\Na sketch request from you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'd be happy to!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.59,0:09:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You two can take a break for now, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.70,0:10:05.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wearing these outfits brings back memories of\Nthe adventure we went on in the other world.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.23,0:10:06.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Traveling around a bunch of places...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fighting demons...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.46,0:10:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Finally defeating the Demon Lord...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.96,0:10:17.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and I, uniting as one...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.20,0:10:19.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That never happened!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.24,0:10:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we were able to make\Neveryone in the other world smile again.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.75,0:10:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The people in this world also seem happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.17,0:10:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which is why the two of us\Nhave a right to be happy, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.86,0:10:37.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's take our relationship to the next level!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.14,0:10:38.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell? Hey—!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.82,0:10:39.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.76,0:10:43.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It might've torn because\Nyou were squirming so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.24,0:10:44.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.06,0:10:47.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay still. We don't want anyone to see us.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.20,0:10:50.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No one's going to get in our way this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.05,0:10:52.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata... It's high time that you and I—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.87,0:10:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.59,0:10:58.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask, but can you help me out?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.37,0:10:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Our bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.96,0:11:01.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apologies for the wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.95,0:11:03.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your support!
